msgstr ":ref:`glossary-mt`."

msgid "New automatic fixer for :ref:`autofix-punctuation-spacing`."
msgstr "Виправлено нову автоматику для :ref:`autofix-punctuation-spacing`."

msgid ""
":ref:`mt-google-translate-api-v3` now better honors placeables or line "
